@host = http://localhost:5117
@token = paste-jwt-token-here
@username = enter-database-username
@password = enter-password
@loanId = enter-loan-id

### Login using an account stored in LoanApiDb
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Current user's loans
GET {{host}}/api/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a Processing loan
POST {{host}}/api/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanType": "FastLoan",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "gel",
  "period": 6
}

### Accountant: read all loans
GET {{host}}/api/accountant/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Accountant: read one loan
GET {{host}}/api/accountant/loans/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Accountant: read the latest API audit records
GET {{host}}/api/accountant/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
